</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="container-fluid"><div data-cy="sidebar_container"><div class="wrapper-spacing"><div class="md:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-[8px]"><div class="col-span-12 lg:mb-0 mb-16 lg:col-span-4"><div class="sticky" style="top:0;opacity:1;transition:all .2s"><div class="lg:w-10/12"><h2 class="font-hubot text-heading-2xl md:text-heading-3xl lg:text-heading-4xl xl:text-heading-5xl font-extrabold uppercase text-orange-600">FAQ</h2></div><div class="mt-6 flex w-full md:w-6/12 lg:mt-10 lg:w-full"><a class="pointer-events-auto whitespace-nowrap font-mono font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-orange-04-a11y text-white hover:bg-orange-900 px-8 py-4 text-base leading-4 uppercase" target="_self" href="/dataaisummit/faq">See full list</a></div></div></div><div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8" style="min-height:0"><div data-cy="accordion_section"><div class="mb-24 lg:mb-32" data-cy="anchor"><hr/><div data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b dark:border-t dark:border-white"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:R4v6kl6:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:Rv6kl6:" class="group flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all text-left no-underline hover:no-underline text-2xl md:text-3xl xl:text-5xl lg:text-[40px] font-medium py-8" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="mr-2 flex flex-col"><h4 class="font-sans text-2xl lg:capitalize text-navy-900 dark:text-white font-semibold !normal-case leading-7 lg:text-2xl">Who should attend Data + AI Summit?</h4></div><span class="shrink-0 font-bold text-navy-900 transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:hidden dark:text-white">+</span><span class="shrink-0 font-bold text-navy-900 transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=closed]:hidden dark:text-white">x</span></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:R4v6kl6:" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rv6kl6:" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-4 pt-0 text-navy-900 font-normal [&amp;&gt;p&gt;a]:underline [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li&gt;ul]:pl-4 [&amp;&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul]:pl-4 dark:text-white text-base lg:text-xl leading-7"><div class="font-sans text-base font-medium leading-6 text-navy-900 dark:text-white"><p>AI/machine learning engineers, data scientists, data engineers and practitioners, app developers, database administrators, business executives, IT decision-makers, product managers, entrepreneurs, investors and more.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b dark:border-t dark:border-white"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:R5f6kl6:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:R1f6kl6:" class="group flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all text-left no-underline hover:no-underline text-2xl md:text-3xl xl:text-5xl lg:text-[40px] font-medium py-8" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="mr-2 flex flex-col"><h4 class="font-sans text-2xl lg:capitalize text-navy-900 dark:text-white font-semibold !normal-case leading-7 lg:text-2xl">What is Data + AI Summit?</h4></div><span class="shrink-0 font-bold text-navy-900 transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:hidden dark:text-white">+</span><span class="shrink-0 font-bold text-navy-900 transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=closed]:hidden dark:text-white">x</span></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:R5f6kl6:" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:R1f6kl6:" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-4 pt-0 text-navy-900 font-normal [&amp;&gt;p&gt;a]:underline [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li&gt;ul]:pl-4 [&amp;&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul]:pl-4 dark:text-white text-base lg:text-xl leading-7"><div class="font-sans text-base font-medium leading-6 text-navy-900 dark:text-white"><p>The premier event for the global data, analytics and AI community. Summit brings together data practitioners, leaders and visionaries from more than 160 countries to explore the latest technologies and trends. Attendees can also participate in conference training and brand-new certification courses.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b dark:border-t dark:border-white"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:R5v6kl6:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:R1v6kl6:" class="group flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all text-left no-underline hover:no-underline text-2xl md:text-3xl xl:text-5xl lg:text-[40px] font-medium py-8" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="mr-2 flex flex-col"><h4 class="font-sans text-2xl lg:capitalize text-navy-900 dark:text-white font-semibold !normal-case leading-7 lg:text-2xl">Where will Data + AI Summit 2027 be held?</h4></div><span class="shrink-0 font-bold text-navy-900 transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:hidden dark:text-white">+</span><span class="shrink-0 font-bold text-navy-900 transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=closed]:hidden dark:text-white">x</span></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:R5v6kl6:" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:R1v6kl6:" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-4 pt-0 text-navy-900 font-normal [&amp;&gt;p&gt;a]:underline [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li&gt;ul]:pl-4 [&amp;&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul]:pl-4 dark:text-white text-base lg:text-xl leading-7"><div class="font-sans text-base font-medium leading-6 text-navy-900 dark:text-white"><p>The conference will take place at Moscone North, West and South (the address is 747 Howard Street, San Francisco, CA 94103). Some events and activities may be a short walking distance from Moscone.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b dark:border-t dark:border-white"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:R6f6kl6:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:R2f6kl6:" class="group flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all text-left no-underline hover:no-underline text-2xl md:text-3xl xl:text-5xl lg:text-[40px] font-medium py-8" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="mr-2 flex flex-col"><h4 class="font-sans text-2xl lg:capitalize text-navy-900 dark:text-white font-semibold !normal-case leading-7 lg:text-2xl">Where should I stay for the event? </h4></div><span class="shrink-0 font-bold text-navy-900 transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:hidden dark:text-white">+</span><span class="shrink-0 font-bold text-navy-900 transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=closed]:hidden dark:text-white">x</span></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:R6f6kl6:" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:R2f6kl6:" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-4 pt-0 text-navy-900 font-normal [&amp;&gt;p&gt;a]:underline [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li&gt;ul]:pl-4 [&amp;&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul]:pl-4 dark:text-white text-base lg:text-xl leading-7"><div class="font-sans text-base font-medium leading-6 text-navy-900 dark:text-white"><p>We’ve partnered with several hotels in San Francisco offering special group rates for attendees. Book through the Data + AI Summit registration page to receive the event rate (subject to availability). See the list of recommended <u><a target="_self" href="/dataaisummit/travel">hotels</a></u>, all conveniently located near Moscone Center. Due to the World Cup being hosted nearby, we recommend you book your hotel early.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b dark:border-t dark:border-white"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-:R6v6kl6:" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-:R2v6kl6:" class="group flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all text-left no-underline hover:no-underline text-2xl md:text-3xl xl:text-5xl lg:text-[40px] font-medium py-8" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="mr-2 flex flex-col"><h4 class="font-sans text-2xl lg:capitalize text-navy-900 dark:text-white font-semibold !normal-case leading-7 lg:text-2xl">What is included in the full conference all-access pass?</h4></div><span class="shrink-0 font-bold text-navy-900 transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:hidden dark:text-white">+</span><span class="shrink-0 font-bold text-navy-900 transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=closed]:hidden dark:text-white">x</span></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:R6v6kl6:" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-:R2v6kl6:" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-4 pt-0 text-navy-900 font-normal [&amp;&gt;p&gt;a]:underline [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li&gt;ul]:pl-4 [&amp;&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul]:pl-4 dark:text-white text-base lg:text-xl leading-7"><div class="font-sans text-base font-medium leading-6 text-navy-900 dark:text-white"><p>The full conference all-access pass will include keynotes, Expo, breakout sessions, networking events and virtual access.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="container-fluid"><div data-cy="horizontal_divider"><div class="wrapper-spacing"><img alt="Divider" data-ot-ignore="1" fetchpriority="high" width="345" height="8" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="optanon-category-C0001 duration-1000 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-75 min-h-2 h-2 w-full object-cover object-center blur-sm grayscale" style="color:transparent" src="/dataaisummit/divider-mobile.svg" /></div></div></div><div class="container-fluid"><div data-cy="sponsors"><div><div class="pt-0 pb-0 mb-16" id="sponsors-section"><div class="border-none gap-6 pt-4 dark:pt-0 md:grid md:grid-cols-12"><div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4"><h2 class="font-hubot text-heading-2xl md:text-heading-3xl lg:text-heading-4xl xl:text-heading-5xl font-extrabold uppercase text-orange-600 md:mb-0 mb-0" id="sponsorsTitle">Sponsors</h2></div><div class="col-span-12 flex flex-col items-start lg:col-span-8"><div class="font-sans text-2xl leading-8 font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white [&amp;&gt;p&gt;a]:underline [&amp;&gt;ul]:list-disc [&amp;&gt;ul]:list-inside [&amp;&gt;ul&gt;li]:pl-4 break-words mt-6 md:mt-0"><p>Data + AI Summit couldn’t happen without our awesome sponsors. Interested in sponsoring? Reach out to our Sponsorship Management team to learn about available opportunities.</p></div><div class="flex mt-6 lg:mt-[48px]"><a class="pointer-events-auto whitespace-nowrap font-mono font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-orange-04-a11y text-white hover:bg-orange-900 px-8 py-4 text-base leading-4 landing landing-register-button uppercase" target="_self" href="https://dataaisummit.databricks.com/flow/db/dais2026/sponsors/page/catalog">SEE ALL SPONSORS</a></div></div></div></div><div class="wrapper-spacing"><div class="sessions-slider relative -left-6 lg:-left-16"><div c