out of) planes in his spare time, he is also a DJ in his spare time!","format":"basic_html","processed":"With over 13 years of experience in data \u0026amp; analytics within the aviation industry working for two of the UK's most well-known airlines, Tom has led the development of data products, data platforms, analytics environments and evolved the airline's data governance and its data culture. Tom's latest focus has been in the world of Customer Analytics and the platforms that fuel them to unlock value for both the airline and the experience of its customers. Tom is lives on the South Coast of the UK and loves jumping on (and out of) planes in his spare time, he is also a DJ in his spare time!"},"field_speaker_first_name":"Tom","field_speaker_last_name":"Barber","field_speaker_unique_id":"1693843431850001FR4D_176365898538dais2026","links":{"self":{"href":"https://microsites.databricks.com/jsonapi/node/dataaisummit2026_speaker/49d84837-bfeb-4f57-adcc-5f287be527ab?resourceVersion=id%3A25417"},"working-copy":{"href":"https://microsites.databricks.com/jsonapi/node/dataaisummit2026_speaker/49d84837-bfeb-4f57-adcc-5f287be527ab?resourceVersion=rel%3Aworking-copy"}},"resourceIdObjMeta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":17781},"node_type":{"type":"node_type--node_type","id":"4a4790a8-5e3c-45d2-8f0f-ffb0a609a5db","resourceIdObjMeta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":"dataaisummit2026_speaker"}},"revision_uid":null,"uid":null,"field_media_image":null,"field_speaker_image":{"type":"file--file","id":"6853e178-e55c-4935-b1f8-3b879f135f38","resourceIdObjMeta":{"alt":"Tom Barber","title":"Tom Barber","width":200,"height":200,"drupal_internal__target_id":5423}},"relationshipNames":["node_type","revision_uid","uid","field_media_image","field_speaker_image"]}],"field_agenda_track":[{"type":"taxonomy_term--dataaisummit_agenda_track","id":"bd4afb19-4e78-4ac9-9b91-8b349e37d4bb","drupal_internal__tid":2081,"drupal_internal__revision_id":2081,"langcode":"en","revision_created":"2026-04-14T20:59